        "Id3": {
            "text": "GMA New Media, Inc. is a subsidiary of GMA Network. GMA New Media offers applications in the Entertainment Industry. Felipe Gozon is the key person in GMA New Media. Both Philippine Entertainment Portal, Inc. and Digify Inc. are subsidiaries of the company."
